{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04304","headline":"太平公主山亭侍宴 · 张昌宗","name":"太平公主山亭侍宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南有小山，嬴女隐其间。\n折桂芙蓉浦，吹箫明月湾。\n扇掩将雏曲，钗承堕马鬟。\n欢情本无限，莫掩洛城关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昌宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}